translated_text:
BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY

REGENT OF PRINGSEWU,
a. that every citizen has human rights that must be guaranteed by the state to obtain a sense of security, be protected and be free from all forms of violence.
b. that women and children are vulnerable groups, so they need to receive protection and services from the state that can provide prevention, protection and services to victims of violence;

c. that regional governments together with the community are obliged to carry out prevention, protection and recovery efforts for children and women victims of violence for the sake of honor and protection of human dignity;

d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b and letter c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning the Implementation of Protection for Women and Children Victims of Violence;

