translated_text:
CHAPTERV

RIGHTS OF VICTIMS

Article 13

Every victim has the right to obtain:
a. protection;
b. information;
c. optimal service;
d. continuous handling up to the rehabilitation stage; Ie. confidential handling;
f. psychological and legal assistance; and  g. guarantee of rights related to the victim's status as a family member and community member.

