b. melakukan sosialisasi peraturan perundang undangan yang berkaitan dengan perlindungan  Perempuan dan Anak Korban Kekerasan;
c. mengadakan pendidikan tentang nilai-nilai anti  kekerasan terhadap anak dan perempuan; dan  d. mengadakan pemantauan dan evaluasi terhadap  penyelenggaraan perlindungan Perempuan dan  Anak korban kekerasan.
2. Pemerintah Daerah berkewajiban melakukan upaya upaya pencegahan, penanganan dan pemulihan  korban kekerasan terhadap Perempuan dan Anak,  menyediakan dan menyelenggarakan layanan bagi  korban dalam bentuk:a. menyediakan dan memfasilitasi terbe n tuknya  pelayanan terpadu untuk korban dengan  melibatkan lembaga dan unsur masyarakat;
b. mendorong kepedulian masyarakat ten.tang  pentingnya perlindungan terhadap korban; dan  c. melakukan pemberdayaan masyarakat untuk  pencegahan tindak kekerasan.

translated_text:
CHAPTER VI

DUTIES AND OBLIGATIONS OF REGIONAL GOVERNMENT

Article 15

1. The Regional Government has the duty to carry out prevention, handling and recovery efforts for victims of violence against Women and Children, by:a. collecting data and information about Women and Children Victims of Violence;
b. conducting socialization of laws and regulations related to the protection of Women and Children Victims of Violence;
c. conducting education on anti-violence values against children and women; and  d. conducting monitoring and evaluation of the implementation of protection for Women and Children victims of violence.
2. The Regional Government is obliged to carry out prevention, handling and recovery efforts for victims of violence against Women and Children, provide and organize services for victims in the form of:a. providing and facilitating the establishment of integrated services for victims by involving institutions and community elements;
b. encouraging public awareness about the importance of protection for victims; and  c. empowering communities to prevent acts of violence.

